; ---- BUBBLE-1: ten bubbles down the whole lab route -------------------------------------------
; Talon, 2026-09-04, off a live playtest: "in the puffing lab scene that was recently added there
; are absolutely no bubbles, which is a shame because it's a really cool place."
;
; Ten (BubbleTestLayout.PuffinLabBubbles), and they are a TRAIL rather than a scatter: four in the
; lab you arrive in, three down the crawl, two along the hallway and one in the black room beside
; the stool. The lab's whole shape is a one-way journey from a room to a television 80 m away, and
; a bubble count that paid only for the first room would pay for none of that journey.
;
; PARENTED TO THE ROOT, NEVER TO Lab OR Route. Those two children carry the 1.38 scale (see the
; header note six blocks up: "The scale sits on the two CHILDREN, never on the root"), so a bubble
; under either of them would be a 1.38x bubble. The root is scale 1, so the positions below are
; PuffinLab-root metres -- world = these + PuffinLabAnchor (90, -14, 90).
;
; WHERE THE NUMBERS COME FROM. Seven of the ten sit 0.9-1.0 m directly above one of the nineteen
; route stations in PuffinLabSelfTest's own table -- the points that suite already proves, every
; run, are standable by the LIVE avatar capsule with a ray-found floor under it and headroom over
; it. A bubble a metre above a point the shipped fit check proves a body stands at is reachable by
; construction, and it stays proven when the avatar's height changes, because that table is
; re-measured rather than asserted. The other three are in the open lab floor, clear by more than
; a metre of every collider in PuffinLabRoom's prop table. Nothing here is placed on the four
; ClimbCrates or the ceiling hatch: ResolveStructuralVariants leaves HubAccess_On invisible and
; non-colliding, so a bubble expecting to stand on that geometry would be floating in a sealed
; ceiling.
;
; THIS ADDS NOTHING THE LAB'S OWN CONTRACTS FORBID. Bubble.tscn is an Area3D with collision_layer
; = 0 and monitorable = false, so it is invisible to PuffinLabSelfTest's clearance capsule and
; headroom ray (both CollideWithAreas = false) and cannot make the 19-station fit check go red; it
; carries no CanvasLayer, ColorRect, Control, WorldEnvironment or Camera3D, so it cannot trip
; CheckNoScreenCover; and it is not a TvPortal, so CheckSeam still finds exactly one. The lowest
; bubble mesh here bottoms out at world y = -20.35, well above the -24 floor TvPortalSelfTest's
; kill-plane margin holds this scene to. THE ROOF ROUTE IS UNTOUCHED -- Talon: "a player can jump
; from the top of the cyan platform down and onto the lab ... I love it please do not change this"
; -- nothing below is outside the lab's interior and nothing below has a collision layer at all.

[node name="Bubbles" type="Node3D" parent="."]

; The lab you arrive in: four, spread across a 22 x 16.5 m floor so the room reads as paying.
; Dead centre, on the "lab centre" station.
