; The crawl. Three, on stations "crawl 2", "crawl 4" and "crawl 6", each 0.9 m above the
; centreline of a tube whose clear cross-section is 2.62 x 2.42 m. The floor there is a
; noise-displaced trimesh, so these ride the station the suite rays to, never an authored y.
