; The black room, on the "beside stool" station -- 1.96 m west of the stool's 0.77 m box and 3.4 m
; from the return television, so it is crossed on the way to the way out rather than collected by
; standing in the exit. Nothing is added to the room: the stool stays the only thing in it, and
; Talon's open question about what the black room is FOR is left open.
[node name="Bubble_Lab_10" parent="Bubbles" instance=ExtResource("7_bubble")]
